┌─ Keys · ? to close ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  click     select / focus                                                    │
│  right     node menu                                                         │
│  wheel     scroll                                                            │
│  drag      move node                                                         │
│Org pane                                                                      │
│  ↑↓        move                                                              │
│  ←→        fold / unfold                                                     │
│  enter     open agent pane                                                   │
│  space     give work                                                         │
│  s         start / stop                                                      │
│  r         resume                                                            │
│  n         new here…                                                         │
│  e         edit (Duo: Edit org)                                              │
│  m         move to…                                                          │
│  d         delete (stopped)                                                  │
│  z         zoom agent                                                        │
│  v         last reply on/off                                                 │
│  o         open org.toml                                                     │
│Needs you                                                                     │
